      "subject": "מפה אל פה",
      "rationale": "Aḍris-agi yenna-d « seg yimi ɣer yimi », d taɣawsa n wawal; tasuqilt taqbaylit teqqim ɣer unamek uslig: tamurt teččur-iten seg yiwen n iglem ɣer wayeḍ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "nidda",
      "rationale": "נדה d taṛeẓẓi (tasaḥit n tmeṭṭut) — tettwaseqbal da s « taṛeẓẓi », maca taɛbranit tessaɛa taɣawsa n wawal n tnefsut i d-yeffɣen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "בתועבבתיהם...בטמאתם",
      "rationale": "Kra n yimsuqelen (KJV, JPS) ssnan « tiṭṭeflin » d « llaxder » deg yiwen n wemkan; taɛbranit tessaɛa snat n tɣawsiwin, yerna ur ttwarant ara d yiwen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "neḥḥer",
      "rationale": "Yal awal ɣer temsarin deg Leɛqub 9 — aṭas n wawalen n Yisrael i d-yettwabedren s « kkten », d awal i d-yettwaḥerzen i ufus n Yisrael."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "i t-ḥettmeḍ s ufus n yimdanen-ik, inaviyen, ad yemmeslayen d navi: Tamurt ara kecmeḍ i teddiḍ-tt, tamurt n tṛeẓẓi n yegdachen n tmura i d-lla, s tiṭṭeflin-nnsen, i qbelen t-ciččen seg yiwen n imi ɣer wayeḍ, s llaxder-nnsen.",
